  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Regional Governance Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indo-Pacific Governance Programme will support the foundations on which FCDO can deliver the UK objectives in the Indo-Pacific by establishing partnerships for &#x2018;progressive governance&#x2019; that enable broader UK priorities in the region. Support will be based on a combination of a) strategic programming b) deep context analysis and learning, and c) increased capacity to deliver advice and support to governance actors in the region. The programme will build on a base of successful projects and will test a long-term approach for strategic engagement on governance in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
